      <marc:subfield code="a">In this 21 minute DVD students discover the uses of various sizes and grades of eggs, what the eggshell&apos;s color means, egg nutrients, how to store eggs, cooking temperatures and more. Chef Dave Christopherson explains the many uses of the egg while demonstrating a variety of delicious, easy to prepare egg dishes, including scrambled eggs, sunny side up egg, over easy egg, basted egg, poached egg, Hollandaise sauce, omelet, strata, frittata, and quiche. Includes a 5 day activity and lesson plan resource binder.</marc:subfield>
